      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need some help with our inventory logic. we're seeing some weird stockouts on our lithium-ion battery cells lately. can you help me figure out a formula for setting safety stock levels? we're sourcing from shenzhen so lead times vary a lot and it's messing up our reorder points.",
